1. (asai2023selfraglearningto pages 22-24): Akari Asai, Zeqiu Wu, Yizhong Wang, Avirup Sil, and Hannaneh Hajishirzi. Self-rag: learning to retrieve, generate, and critique through self-reflection. arXiv (Cornell University), Oct 2023. URL: https://doi.org/10.48550/arxiv.2310.11511, doi:10.48550/arxiv.2310.11511. This article has 1088 citations.
